  "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Handpainted2Dgame corner tile atlas.1024x1024,EXACT4columns4rows16squarecells. Side-on front elevation,NO perspective. Eachcell filled with square soil or stone material,only stated OUTERquarter is empty. Think marching-squares terrain corner masks. Row1 grasssoil four CONVEX OUTER corners,eachisFILLEDrectanglewithONEroundedoutercorner:top-left,top-right,bottom-left,bottom-right. Large opaque material body90percentcell,neverLshapedbracket. Row2 grasssoil four CONCAVE INNER corners: otherwiseFULLSQUAREmaterialwithONEclear128x128squareCUTOUT at top-left,top-right,bottom-left,bottom-right. MaterialcoversremainingTHREEquarters,neverthinLbracket. Row3 sameFOURconvexoutercorners in aged gray mossstone. Row4 sameFOURconcaveinnercorners in aged gray mossstone. Richpainterlymaterials moss/earthcooltealshadows,no scenery/props/characters/text/shadows/glows/gridlines. AlphaONLYoutsidecornerandinsidecutout,opaqueinteriors. Exactfullsquarecellcoveragewithnohugemargins. Distincttopologyforoutervsinnercorners.",
