      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Lanterns Underroot hand-painted 2D platformer TERRAIN sprite atlas. Rich painterly wood/stone/soil materials, selective crisp silhouettes, restrained brush texture, moss/earth palette with cool teal-blue shadows and warm muted edges. Strict SIDE-ON ORTHOGRAPHIC camera, flat collision tops, no perspective top faces. Exactly1024x1024 square canvas, FOUR equal columns and FOUR equal rows, exactly16equal256pxcells. ONE complete module PER CELL, fitting inside, no spanning. Reading order row-by-row as listed. Genuine alpha outside material and under floating modules, opaque material interiors. NO scenery, props, characters, floor, lamps, glows, shadows, lettering, gridlines, dividers or labels. Four-by-four source modules for64px export, prototype edges pending seam repair. Reusable corner terrain set. Row1 FOUR grass-topped soil OUTER corners: top-left,top-right,bottom-left,bottom-right. Row2 FOUR grass/soil INNER concave corners: top-left,top-right,bottom-left,bottom-right, clearly concave cutouts with transparent quarter. Row3 FOUR moss stone OUTER corners: top-left,top-right,bottom-left,bottom-right. Row4 FOUR moss stone INNER concave corners: top-left,top-right,bottom-left,bottom-right. Each concavity must be genuine empty alpha. No isolated decorative islands.",
      "review": "Bracket silhouettes repeated, superseded by clearer corner topology repair."
    }
  ],
